  <h1 class="site-home-h2" style="font-size:2rem">A basement is not a problem.</h1>
  <p class="site-words">Lose signal on site and your messages wait on your phone. When you are back in signal they arrive, in the order you sent them.</p>
  <p class="site-words">You do not need to do anything. Keep going round, answer as you would, and the messages catch up.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Nothing is filed until you say done, so a gap in signal never closes a Record early.</p>
  <p class="site-words">Quickler uses WhatsApp or Telegram as they already work on your phone, so there is no separate app that needs a connection to sync.</p>
